  "starterCode": "-- Write your SQL query here\n",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nVectorized, mathematically sound implementation.\n\n### ⚡ Implementation\n```sql\nWITH days AS (\n  SELECT DISTINCT user_id, visit_date::date AS visit_day\n  FROM visits\n), islands AS (\n  SELECT user_id, visit_day,\n         visit_day - (ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY visit_day))::int AS grp\n  FROM days\n), streaks AS (\n  SELECT user_id, MIN(visit_day) AS streak_start, MAX(visit_day) AS streak_end,\n         COUNT(*) AS streak_length\n  FROM islands\n  GROUP BY user_id, grp\n), ranked AS (\n  SELECT *, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (\n    PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY streak_length DESC, streak_start\n  ) AS rn\n  FROM streaks\n)\nSELECT user_id, streak_start, streak_end, streak_length\nFROM ranked\nWHERE rn = 1\nORDER BY user_id;\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
